WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.010
Hey Thoughty2 here.

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:06.020
Have you ever had a burning question which
you've always wanted answered, but you've

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.400
never known where to turn, or who to ask?

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.129
Well now's your chance to get it answered,
once and for all.

00:00:13.129 --> 00:00:20.200
I'm so excited to finally be able to announce
my shiny, new website, Thoughty2.com.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:25.020
It's a fantastic way to keep up with my latest
uploads and read the full transcripts of all

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.330
my videos.

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:30.300
It's also the first place on the internet,
along with YouTube, that you will find my

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.619
new videos as soon as they are released.

00:00:32.619 --> 00:00:38.890
But, most importantly, you can go to Thoughty2.com
and ask me any question.

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:43.329
For example "Why is the sky blue?" or "What
are black holes?".

00:00:43.329 --> 00:00:49.170
It can be about science, maths, history, entertainment,
lifestyle, or simply general knowledge.

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:52.470
Pretty much no topic is off limits!

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:55.550
Once you've posted your question anyone can
vote it up.

00:00:55.550 --> 00:01:00.440
You can also vote up other people's questions
if you think they should be answered.

00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:09.920
Every week the questions that have the most
up-votes, I will answer with a video, right

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:13.180
here on YouTube, for everyone to see.

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:17.860
My goal with these video's is to answer your
questions in the simplest way possible so

00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:23.830
everyone can understand it, but at the same
time, keeping it concise and entertaining.

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:27.280
So be sure to visit Thoughty2.com and check
it out.

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:31.670
The website will be constantly evolving with
more features being added so you guys can

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:34.300
get more and more out of it as time goes on.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:39.080
I hope it can be a place for the Thoughty2
community to come together and help make Thoughty2

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:41.640
better and more enjoyable for everyone.

